I enter the metro station.
I have the box of Kaju Katli in my hand.
I scan my pass and go to the platform.
In a short time, the metro arrives.
I board it and sit on a seat.
There is a very nice coolness from the AC in the coach.
I look outside through the window.
The city is speeding by.
Now the metro journey feels very easy to me.
I think that this evening will be very nice.
I am happy that now we also meet outside the office.
Today I will chat a lot with Priya.
We will eat together.
In some time, my stop arrives.
I step down from the metro.
Priya's house is quite close from the station.
Come on, let's go to her house now.
